        "explanation": "Implement `addFront(node)` and `remove(node)` on `DoublyLinkedList`. Because `this.head` and `this.tail` are permanent dummy sentinel nodes, every real node always has non-null `node.prev` and `node.next`. `addFront` splices `node` between `head` and `head.next`; `remove` links `node.prev.next = node.next` and `node.next.prev = node.prev`.",
