        "concept": "Composing Hash Lookups with Intrusive List Promotion",
        "instructions": "### Goal\nImplement `get(key)` and `put(key, value)` on `LRUCache`.\n\n### Invariant\n- Most recently used node sits at `list.head.next`; least recently used sits at `list.tail.prev`.\n- On `get(key)`: unlink node and `addFront(node)`.\n- On `put(key, value)`: if `map.size === capacity`, evict `list.popBack()` and delete its key from `map`.",
