        "explanation": "Implement `_promote(node)` on `LFUCache`. When `node` moves from `oldFreq` to `oldFreq + 1`, remove it from `buckets.get(oldFreq)`. If that bucket becomes empty **and** `this.minFreq === oldFreq`, increment `this.minFreq = oldFreq + 1`. Then insert `node` at the front of `buckets.get(oldFreq + 1)`.",
        "concept": "Shah-Mitra-Matani O(1) Frequency Bucket Advancement",
        "instructions": "### Goal\nImplement `_promote(node)` on `LFUCache`.\n\n### Invariant\nWhen `node` moves from `oldFreq` to `oldFreq + 1`, remove it from `buckets.get(oldFreq)`. If that bucket becomes empty **and** `this.minFreq === oldFreq`, increment `this.minFreq = oldFreq + 1`. Then insert `node` at the front of `buckets.get(oldFreq + 1)`.",
        "hint": "If oldBucket.size === 0 and this.minFreq === oldFreq, set this.minFreq = oldFreq + 1.",
