        "instructions": "### Goal\nImplement `get(key)` with early termination.\n\n### Invariant\nBecause Robin Hood insertion guarantees that any key with a larger `psl` would have displaced an occupant with a smaller `cur.psl`, if `cur === null || psl > cur.psl`, the target key cannot exist further down the probe chain.",
